WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,130
Forget it

2
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:06,970
I'm going in to see your brother. Are you going? No.

3
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:11,410
I'm just passing by my husband

4
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:19,500
Otherwise, it won't be a problem if we take a rest and then go back home, right?

5
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,120
That's exactly what I sent

6
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,840
I asked Chuntao to check

7
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:26,160
Most of the wooden stalls on that street are closed.

8
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,480
The owner is eager to transfer

9
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,160
Behind this is obviously his handle

10
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:31,200
You helped me hold down the store before setting up shop.

11
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,400
I also collected the wheelchair as a matter of course.

12
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,800
Then let's go back to the house first. Sister-in-law, I will have a game today.

13
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:39,960
Lu Yunzhou is too embarrassed to accept the award

14
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:41,680
Congratulations to my sister-in-law for getting a headache
